- I know you think I'm crazy.

787
00:45:14.101 --> 00:45:16.369
Something bad is happening
here, Sarah! Pack up!

788
00:45:16.371 --> 00:45:18.137
Kevin! Kevin don't!

789
00:45:18.139 --> 00:45:21.174
- What the fuck?!
- I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

790
00:45:21.176 --> 00:45:23.076
Kevin!

791
00:45:23.078 --> 00:45:25.578
You have to believe me
