825
00:47:09.016 --> 00:47:11.083
You heard what Omar said.
He's gonna be fine.

826
00:47:11.085 --> 00:47:13.186
Just give him a couple of days.
He's gonna be as good as new.

827
00:47:13.188 --> 00:47:14.686
Don't worry.

828
00:47:14.688 --> 00:47:16.221
Okay.

829
