854
00:49:23.384 --> 00:49:24.884
<i>throughout the old city
of Jerusalem here,</i>

855
00:49:24.886 --> 00:49:27.686
<i>as we see security forces,
police and army</i>

856
00:49:27.688 --> 00:49:30.456
<i>rushing from place to place.
Reports of...</i>

